# Authorship

This repository has a single author: the git user configured on this machine.

- Do not add contributor footnotes, `@author` tags, "Generated by", or similar attribution in source, comments, or docs.
- Do not add `Co-authored-by`, `Signed-off-by` for anyone else, or AI/tool trailers on commits.
- Do not change `git config`. Use the existing local `user.name` / `user.email` as the only commit author.
